WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:03.548
Bright Blue makes the Draw button easy to spot.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.107
Draw two boxes, one for each step in the flow.

3
00:00:09.482 --> 00:00:11.560
Connect them with an arrow to show the order.

4
00:00:12.266 --> 00:00:14.610
Then underline the second step with the pencil.
